{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 33,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nitrogen is everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701,
    "dDurationMs": 1802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a fundamental building block of life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3503,
    "dDurationMs": 5472,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes up 78% of the atmosphere,\nAND it's in these tiny micro bubbles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8975,
    "dDurationMs": 1935,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in my Starbucks 'Nitro-Cold Brew.'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10910,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yes, this episode is sponsored\nby Starbucks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14060,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They challenged me to liquify\nnitrogen out of the air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17780,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's what I'm gonna be doing in this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19080,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But first I'm gonna try Nitro Cold Brew\nfor the first time..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Drinking the nitro cold brew]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25140,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mmmm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25760,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's subtly sweet without having to add sugar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28700,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and obviously it's cold and frothy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30930,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm gonna explain why nitrogen\nmakes this possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33400,
    "dDurationMs": 5305,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But first I'm gonna try to liquify some nitrogen for myself out of this atmosphere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38705,
    "dDurationMs": 967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on, let's go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39672,
    "dDurationMs": 1535,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, in order to make liquid nitrogen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41207,
    "dDurationMs": 3604,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we need a way to make the air really cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44811,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to do that, I'm going to use this cryo-cooler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48281,
    "dDurationMs": 4805,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So essentially what's inside here is a\ncylinder of helium and a couple pistons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53086,
    "dDurationMs": 3804,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a piston that compresses\nthe helium down into this section,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56890,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when it does that, it makes that gas really hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60226,
    "dDurationMs": 5206,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, that heat gets ejected to\nthe surroundings through this heat sink."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65532,
    "dDurationMs": 5472,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then the helium is expanded down in here,\nand as that happens, it gets really cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71004,
    "dDurationMs": 2636,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it absorbs the heat from the surroundings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73640,
    "dDurationMs": 6139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is the part of the cryo-cooler\nthat is going to get down to less than -200°C."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79779,
    "dDurationMs": 1869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So cryogenic temperatures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81648,
    "dDurationMs": 2402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the place where we can really\nliquify some gas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84050,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I want to put this to the test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86052,
    "dDurationMs": 4038,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and first do a sort of simple proof-of-concept and make sure that this is working"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90090,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and just try to liquify air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92520,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "liquify the air in this room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94820,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is Allen Pan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96162,
    "dDurationMs": 1802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen is handier with tools than I am,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97964,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so uuh, I brought him here to help me make\nthis happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100300,
    "dDurationMs": 3303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How should people know you, Allen? Like what do you get into, what's your thing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103603,
    "dDurationMs": 1702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I'm a failed Mythbuster,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105305,
    "dDurationMs": 2869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and also I have a YouTube channel called\n\"Sufficiently Advanced\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108174,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek VO: You may know Allen from\nhis creations and,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110844,
    "dDurationMs": 3703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relevant to this project, shooting\nliquid nitrogen from his hands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114547,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Allen laughs]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117750,
    "dDurationMs": 4605,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I'm definitely breaking your drill by the way \u003e\u003c, that plastic is coming right off. \u003eD: I see that :) I see that.\u003c"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122355,
    "dDurationMs": 1535,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did I measure this correctly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124958,
    "dDurationMs": 1468,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126426,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does it go in and stop right there-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128928,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh my God!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129762,
    "dDurationMs": 901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at that!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131564,
    "dDurationMs": 701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perfect!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132265,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: So now, let's turn it on,\nand you can listen, you can hear it turn on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135268,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ohhhh, the pump is starting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137270,
    "dDurationMs": 868,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Its purring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140000,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Elevator Music]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142540,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the moment of truth:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145740,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "been running the cryo-cooler\nfor about 4 hours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149940,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hopefully getting some liquid air in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152218,
    "dDurationMs": 3704,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I bet you 50 bucks there's at least 50 millilitres of liquid air in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155922,
    "dDurationMs": 1078,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: \"50 millilitres.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158000,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "D: Sir?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158500,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: That's not even that much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160260,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: It ISN'T even that much,\u003e\u003c but\nI will be amazed if it happens. \u003e Allen: It's like a whole-\u003c"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163796,
    "dDurationMs": 4805,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Oh, that- that's 50 millilitres, right there.\nDerek: I bring you a 50 millilitre beaker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169769,
    "dDurationMs": 1431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Do you feel any sloshing??"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173300,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: [Whouf!]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173900,
    "dDurationMs": 1708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Slight sloshing]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175608,
    "dDurationMs": 1992,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I hear something..! \u003eI hear something!\u003c\nDerek: Oh ohoh \u003e\u003c oh oh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177600,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I HEAR something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179000,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: I can hear liquid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180146,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "D: We have made liquid air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182148,
    "dDurationMs": 2069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: That sounds like...\nDerek: How much have we made?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184217,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: 50 millilitres..\nDerek: Is that how much we've made? Allen: ..of liquid air!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187587,
    "dDurationMs": 2413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: OooohH..! Cameraman: Oh hoho hoh! Allen: 50! 50!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191000,
    "dDurationMs": 1292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: OOOhh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192292,
    "dDurationMs": 2969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A: Dude, that's 50 ml of liquid air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195261,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek VO: I know it doesn't look like much,\nbut to make 50 ml of liquid air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198731,
    "dDurationMs": 4638,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we needed to condense around\n35 litres of air from the room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203369,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: What's funny to me is I've done\na lot of experiments with liquid nitrogen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206573,
    "dDurationMs": 5472,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this feels like the most precious... [Allen laughs]\nliquified gas that I've ever had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212045,
    "dDurationMs": 2235,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we made it ourselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215682,
    "dDurationMs": 2936,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was more than 50 ml."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218618,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I know we didn't shake on it,\nbut you definitely owe me $50."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221287,
    "dDurationMs": 513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: I definitely do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221800,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Allen erupts with laughter]  [Cameraman chuckles]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223790,
    "dDurationMs": 2602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: 'Cause that's impressive from just\na few hours!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226659,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Y'know, running it for the first time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228928,
    "dDurationMs": 5472,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek VO: Liquid oxygen is paramagnetic,\nwhich means it's attracted to permanent magnets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234400,
    "dDurationMs": 3304,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to use this effect to try\nto extract some liquid oxygen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237704,
    "dDurationMs": 1568,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Something came out.\nAllen: Hey, dude, you got it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239272,
    "dDurationMs": 2869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You got some.\nDerek VO: See that droplet at the end of the magnets?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242141,
    "dDurationMs": 5139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To make sure it really was liquid oxygen,\nwe tested how it affected a flame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247280,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Yeheheha!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250817,
    "dDurationMs": 2903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: So that's 'for-sure' oxygen, that is liquid oxygen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253753,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: You can see how the matchstick REIGNITES with the liquid oxygen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257590,
    "dDurationMs": 3771,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the flame spreads towards\nthe higher concentration of oxygen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261361,
    "dDurationMs": 1139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Allen laughs]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262500,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Low-pitched squeaking and chuting sounds emanate from the flame]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265500,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Ohh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266000,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[quiet Alien Chestbuster squawk/click sounds emanate from the experiment]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269700,
    "dDurationMs": 903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Whwch!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270603,
    "dDurationMs": 2703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: There you go, we have made: liquid air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273306,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next step: remove the oxygen,\nand just make liquid nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277477,
    "dDurationMs": 901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Allen wheezes with laughter]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278378,
    "dDurationMs": 2903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Okay, it is day two and time to scale up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281281,
    "dDurationMs": 4471,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are uh, moving the cryo-cooler to a bigger stand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286252,
    "dDurationMs": 2069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Should I just go?\nDerek Behind Cam: Yeah, go for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288321,
    "dDurationMs": 2235,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I'm putting a lot of sawdust\ninto your-into your carpet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290556,
    "dDurationMs": 1869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sorry.\nDerek: [chuckles] That's okay, Allen :)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292425,
    "dDurationMs": 975,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Allen laughs lightly]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Chugging, whirring and banging spark sounds]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298300,
    "dDurationMs": 3201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek VO: To make pure nitrogen,\nwe need pressurised air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301501,
    "dDurationMs": 2869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I've got an air compressor here in the garage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304370,
    "dDurationMs": 2603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: The pressure of this compressor\nis about 10 'atmospheres'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306973,
    "dDurationMs": 2402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm going to pressurise this line here..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309776,
    "dDurationMs": 2435,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "behind cam: Now the first thing we've got on the line is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312945,
    "dDurationMs": 2837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a filter to remove.. water vapour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316082,
    "dDurationMs": 3403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to get pure nitrogen,\nthis is the key component."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319485,
    "dDurationMs": 1836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a nitrogen membrane,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321621,
    "dDurationMs": 4971,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what it actually contains is a bunch\nof hollow polymer fibres."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326592,
    "dDurationMs": 3637,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we supply compressed air in this end,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330229,
    "dDurationMs": 5473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all of the gas molecules try to diffuse out of those fibres because of that high pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335768,
    "dDurationMs": 732,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336500,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these polymer fibres are made out of\na material that is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340000,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "SELECTIVELY PERMEABLE."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341200,
    "dDurationMs": 6347,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It allows oxygen and carbon dioxide and water vapour to diffuse out much faster than nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347547,
    "dDurationMs": 4671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, those gases actually come out\npreferentially through these holes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352218,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what you're left with at the end is a high concentration of nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356756,
    "dDurationMs": 1735,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to get the highest purity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358491,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what you need to do is have a very high pressure and a slow flow rate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362161,
    "dDurationMs": 3437,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because that gives a lot of time for\nthose other gases to escape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365598,
    "dDurationMs": 1401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Whoo!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369268,
    "dDurationMs": 1632,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "D: I don't know about this gauge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370900,
    "dDurationMs": 1004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Allen laughs]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371904,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: So what I want to count on the watch is how long it takes to increase the pressure in the tank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378044,
    "dDurationMs": 1368,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we worked it out yesterday"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379412,
    "dDurationMs": 2569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we figured out if it takes six minutes\nto fill the tank..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382548,
    "dDurationMs": 4705,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at 100 psi (pressure per inch²), then we've got 98% pure nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387253,
    "dDurationMs": 1101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Cool, perfect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388354,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Right, we just have to be very slow\nwith this tank filling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391424,
    "dDurationMs": 1868,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I don't know if we ARE that slow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394127,
    "dDurationMs": 5839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're going to try to check the oxygen levels that have come through this membrane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400032,
    "dDurationMs": 1635,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Let's put some money on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401667,
    "dDurationMs": 3871,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How about 50 bucks says the oxygen\nis less than 5%. (\u003c5%)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405905,
    "dDurationMs": 1802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah?\nDerek: Are you gonna bet that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407707,
    "dDurationMs": 2703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause I will easily take that bet.\nAllen: Yeah. All right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410410,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: I don't think this went very well\nbecause that was the first filling of the tank,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413880,
    "dDurationMs": 2202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we weren't high pressure going through the membrane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416082,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I don't think it's going to be..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417917,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I think we're getting 95% nitrogen.\nDerek: 95% nitrogen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421420,
    "dDurationMs": 1669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this meter measures oxygen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423089,
    "dDurationMs": 3603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're looking for a number less than 5%,\nwhich I suspect we will not see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427200,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "D: Huuh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428500,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "D: Can hear-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429000,
    "dDurationMs": 3398,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[BEEPING] Allen: Oh, it going down! D: Whoa!\nA: It's going way down. D: WHOA!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432398,
    "dDurationMs": 1068,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[BEEP BEEP]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433466,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Come on 5%! Fi-\nOhhhh...!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435468,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There it is!\nDerek: Whoa!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437303,
    "dDurationMs": 6173,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "D: Here we go 99.\nAllen: Over 99%, 99.2, 99.3"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443476,
    "dDurationMs": 5205,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Whoa, I am shocked.\nAllen:There is no oxygen in this air, baby, it's all nitrogen!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448681,
    "dDurationMs": 3537,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "99.5.\nDerek: I am so shocked right now!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452220,
    "dDurationMs": 3438,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: So we're at 50 bucks for the liquid air bet?\nDerek: Yeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455660,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: We're at 50 bucks for the oxygen.\nDerek: Yeah, you just have made yourself 100 bucks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458520,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at that, 99.7..!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460000,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: ..% nitrogen!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462300,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: This is insane,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464600,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can understand why there would be an alarm if, uh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467000,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Allen laughs]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467500,
    "dDurationMs": 3092,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you were in a room with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470592,
    "dDurationMs": 1613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both: 0.3% oxygen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472205,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Yeah.\nAllen: I knew it. I told you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474958,
    "dDurationMs": 2619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: You knew that you would win.\nAllen: Didn't I tell you? Yes!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477577,
    "dDurationMs": 3506,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Okay. So we've achieved, I guess,\nthe second part of this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481083,
    "dDurationMs": 2697,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is isolating nitrogen from the atmosphere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483780,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now we just have to... \nAllen: Get it super cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486900,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we got to do is we got to put\nthis thing.. here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491120,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek VO: For better insulation, we scaled up to a dewar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493780,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: That's impressive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494900,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Kinda sci-fi, janky garage, sci-fi\nkind of a look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499940,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: Go ahead and lower that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502001,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know just squish right on.\nDerek: I hope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505120,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I mean that's sealed,\ny'know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508000,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Derek laughs]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508720,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I think, uh, honestly? We could just turn it on\nand see if it works at this point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512880,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514020,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just letting some nitrogen in there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516449,
    "dDurationMs": 3737,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that when the nitrogen goes in there,\nit'll push out any..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521287,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "remaining air that's still in the tank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523990,
    "dDurationMs": 4810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Gonna switch on the 'variac' which\npowers up the cryo-cooler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528800,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other thing I need is the fan..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531660,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A: Yes.\nD:This is the fan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533140,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to plug THAT in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534940,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a cooling fan of the cryo-cooler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537160,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're up to 8 Watts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539040,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen behind cam: OoOooOh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[More Elevator Music]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542480,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Okay, I have been running the nitrogen setup for about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545800,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3 hours,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546780,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my concern - because the temperature\non the thermo-couple never got very low -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551700,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was that I wasn't actually making\nany liquid nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554520,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I've stopped the test and I just want to see..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558860,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether or not there is anything in here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doesn't sound like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Pant-laughs]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568768,
    "dDurationMs": 872,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nothing..!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569640,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570540,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I think could be part of the problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572960,
    "dDurationMs": 3215,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was putting nitrogen possibly\nat a rate that's too high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576200,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is effectively nitrogen coming in\nat room temperature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580960,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I wonder if it was just too warm\nfor it to ever reach"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586240,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the liquifying temperature right here\nat the end of the, uh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589420,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the cold finger of the cryocooler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591340,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I feel like I need a slower flow rate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593340,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe a better way to introduce\nthe nitrogen into the dewar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597530,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not- as- easy as I'd hoped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600166,
    "dDurationMs": 3804,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, my plan is to go with a smaller flask,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604804,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "..something like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607180,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, we are going to use its lid to make a nice tight seal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610960,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Except we're going to cut a hole through the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613613,
    "dDurationMs": 2187,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I think it's good enough for this coldfinger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615800,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Alright."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616700,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then we're going to try to drill\na hole in the side for the supply of nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621460,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need to make nice tight seals\naround both of those things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624460,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that is going to be the challenge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626060,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the kind of- the new design here\nthat we've got."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630600,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Allen giggles]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631300,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: I feel like it's pretty good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633040,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I think it's going to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634520,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we're going to wake up, and there's going to be liquid nitrogen in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636780,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Yet more Elevator Music]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639500,
    "dDurationMs": 6980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: I bet you $160 that there is\nliquid nitrogen in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646480,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: I don't know if I'll take that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647500,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Allen laughs uproariously]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649480,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna turn down the cryo-cooler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653520,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Aaand.."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654400,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's see what we got..?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657320,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It looks cold..\nAllen: Yeah, there's definitely some condensation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661220,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's something cold in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664160,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you see?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665200,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both: OHHHH!!!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667460,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen: THERE'S LIQUID NITROGEN!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668000,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: Haha! Allen: There's like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669300,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's like THIS much.. That's liquid nitrogen!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672520,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "D: We have: some liquid nitrogen out of the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677500,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allen through laughter: That was so much effort for this much..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680220,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek VO: So, what do you do with homemade\nliquid nitrogen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682920,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, make homemade ice cream."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685100,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a bit of cream and sugar,\nand then the liquid nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690220,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek: The most precious liquid nitrogen I've ever had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695040,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it enough to make ice cream?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697120,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come have a look, have a look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[DRAMATIC PAUSE]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703800,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705000,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By freezing everything so fast,\nbecause it is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708300,
    "dDurationMs": 3778,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-196 Celsius,\nyou get really small ice crystals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712078,
    "dDurationMs": 5238,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so that gives the ice cream\na really smooth flavour, smooth texture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717316,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Can Allen have some?)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718150,
    "dDurationMs": 5481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a lot of stores, Starbucks too generates nitrogen just out of the air, because-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724000,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why not? It's an available resource."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725560,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They purify it and then infuse it inline into the drink,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729100,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creating millions of those tiny bubbles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731740,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That gives it its unique texture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734460,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So nitrogen bubbles are much smaller\nthan the bubbles you're normally used to:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738120,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the carbon dioxide bubbles that you find in soda."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740540,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that gives this a sort of creamier texture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744000,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other nice thing about nitrogen\nis that it's totally inert."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747280,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it doesn't react with the drink."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749060,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "CO2 reacts with water creating some acid,\nwhich you might like in soda."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753753,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might want a little bit of a sour tangy flavour, but you don't want that in coffee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758257,
    "dDurationMs": 1523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hence, the nitrogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759780,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One thing I found really interesting\nwhen they were pouring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762461,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this Nitro Cold Brew is that you can\nactually see bubbles coming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765940,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down on the sides of the glass!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768240,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's strange, because these bubbles\nare obviously less dense than the coffee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773305,
    "dDurationMs": 2775,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They should be rising up to the surface."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776080,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why are they doing that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777620,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the answer is the nitrogen bubbles\nare rising up to the surface a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781620,
    "dDurationMs": 1495,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the center of the drink."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783115,
    "dDurationMs": 4738,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so that actually creates a current that\npushes them down around the outside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787853,
    "dDurationMs": 3147,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so that's why you see those\nbubbles cascading down at the beginning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791000,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you're pouring the Nitro Cold Brew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792920,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there you have it: nitrogen is everywhere and useful for lots of things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796620,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to try out a Nitro Cold Brew,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798360,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll put a link to order it down\nin the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800580,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And thanks for watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801740,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Outro Sound FX]"
    } ]
  } ]
}
